// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// LESSON 0.1 — WHAT YOU'RE BUILDING NOW
// Dominant concept: A Cairo contract is permanent code that handles real money —
// you are now the person who writes it, not the person who uses it.
