// 5 lessons · Portfolio push Phase 3 ■
// Prerequisite: Lab 2 complete
//
// KNOWLEDGE ENTERING THIS LAB (from Labs 0–2):
//   — Full Cairo type system, structs, enums, Option, Result
//   — Function signatures: ref/@, external/view/internal, caller checks
//   — Ownership: move, snapshot, Copy
//   — Traits, generics, all derives
