//   — Events with #[key], indexing pipeline
//   — Cross-contract calls, atomicity, CEI pattern
//   — ISLAND CONTEXT: L293 (every wallet is a contract), L296 (Cartridge session keys),
//     L297 (gasless transactions), L308 (developer stack overview)
