// LESSON 10.5 — DEPLOYMENT OPERATIONS: SEPOLIA → MAINNET
// Dominant concept: Production launch uses TVL caps, circuit breakers,
// and a phased rollout — Vesu-style — to validate the protocol under
// real conditions while limiting downside if a bug is found.
