// LESSON 11.1 — VESTING SCHEDULES: TOKEN SUPPLY OVER TIME
// Dominant concept: A token's vesting schedule determines when supply
// becomes available — linear, cliff+linear, and back-loaded curves
// create radically different sell pressure and retention profiles.
