// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// LESSON 11.2 — FEE DISTRIBUTION: CAIRO IMPLEMENTATION
// Dominant concept: Protocol fees split between treasury, stakers, and LPs —
// the split is a governance parameter with measurable consequences on
// each group's APY and the protocol's self-sustainability.
// Type B
